sequenceDiagram
  actor Admin as Authorized operator
  participant LLM as Optional local model
  participant Runner as Allowlisted read-only runner
  participant API as Admin-authenticated report API
  participant DB as SQLite
  Admin->>LLM: Ask for an attendance summary
  LLM->>Runner: Structured tool name and bounded arguments
  Runner->>Runner: Validate name, date range, and caller authorization
  Runner->>API: GET report endpoint only
  API->>DB: Parameterized SELECT
  DB-->>API: Verified rows/aggregates
  API-->>Runner: Structured result
  Runner-->>LLM: Data plus provenance/date
  LLM-->>Admin: Explanation labeled as model-generated from returned records
  Note over LLM,DB: Optional and deferred; no model write access, SQL access, sensor control, or cloud transmission
